    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d230">

                <pb facs="0407" n="377" xml:id="pg377"/>

                <head>230. Telegram From the CIA Station in [<hi rendition="#italic">place not
                        declassified</hi>] to Operation PBSUCCESS Headquarters in Florida<anchor
                        n="1" xml:id="d230-f1"/></head>
                <dateline>[<hi rendition="#italic">place not declassified</hi>], <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1954-06-24T10:59:00+00:00">June 24, 1954,
                        1059Z</date>.</dateline>
                <p>1100. Re: DIR 02987.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d230-f2"/></p>
                <p>Osorio told Ambassador following 23 June: <list>
                        <label>A.</label>
                        <item>Does not trust ERRATIC and has never seen him although ERRATIC has
                            claimed Osorio support.</item>
                        <label>B.</label>
                        <item>ERRATIC attempted on several occasions to arrange interview with
                            him.</item>
                        <label>C.</label>
                        <item>Osorio not supporting Calligeris.</item>
                        <label>D.</label>
                        <item>Calligeris and ERRATIC individually too ambitious and ERRATIC should
                            throw in his support with Calligeris.</item>
                    </list></p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
